Hello everyone,

The Honors College is trying to gather information about undergraduate rese=
arch and is asking for each of us to briefly display the attached image at =
the beginning of classes so students can scan the QR code and fill out the =
survey if they had any research experiences this summer. If you'd be willin=
g to do that, it would be greatly appreciated.


Thanks,
Matt



Dr. Matthew Patitz
Professor
Thomas Clinton Mullins Endowed Chair in Engineering
Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science
University of Arkansas

